  "worked_solution": "The matrix $E$ is obtained by multiplying the first row of the identity matrix  by $-4$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $EA$ is equivalent to applying the row operation ${R}_{1}:=-4{R}_{1}$ to $A.$",
